### Fichas

# Listar fichas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/fichas

### Obtener ficha por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/fichas/1

### Crear ficha
POST http://localhost:3000/api/fichas
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "1234567",
  "formacionId": 1,
  "fechaInicio": "2025-01-01",
  "fechaFin": "2025-12-31"
}

### Actualizar ficha
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/fichas/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "1234567-UPDATED",
  "fechaFin": "2026-06-30"
}

### Eliminar ficha
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/fichas/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>